  "schema:name": "Health Management Information System",
  "schema:description": "The Health Management Information System is a governed, sharedapplication component responsible for the systematic collection, aggregation, analysis, and dissemination of population-level and facility-level health data to support routine monitoring, programme performance measurement, strategic planning, health services commissioning, and public health decision-making.",
